        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Asif Kapadia, James Gay-Rees, George Pank, Paul Bell\n- Films: Oasis: Supersonic, Amy (2015 film)\n- Companies: Krishwerkz Entertainment, On The Corner Films, Playmaker Films, Universal Music, Film 4\n- Roles: director, producer, executive producer\n\nFacts:\n- Asif Kapadia and James Gay-Rees won an Oscar for the film \"Amy\" before they worked on \"Oasis: Supersonic.\"\n- In \"Oasis: Supersonic,\" Asif Kapadia served as executive producer and James Gay-Rees served as film producer.\n- \"Amy\" was directed by Asif Kapadia.\n- \"Amy\" was produced by James Gay-Rees, George Pank, and Paul Bell.\n- \"Amy\" was co-produced by Krishwerkz Entertainment, On The Corner Films, Playmaker Films, and Universal Music in association with Film 4.",
